			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://social.polotek.net/@polotek\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>polotek</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I mean I am trying to imagine how components usage will look like in tempales. I just remember all that pain with Handlebars and EJS and how much of a fresh air was JSX</p>",
